# Virtual desktops (0.0.5j): Super+2 shows an empty second desktop (the
# taskbar has no buttons, the squares show which desktops hold windows);
# the calculator opened there stays there; Super+1 comes back to the
# terminal; Super+Shift+2 moves the terminal over; clicking a square
# switches too. 1280x800; the squares sit left of the tray chevron (x≈1044):
# desktop 1 at about x=950, desktop 2 at x=968.
gui: desktop up at 1280x800
cerberus kernel shell
!keys meta_l 2
!wait 0.5
!screenshot build/desks-1.png
!mouseto 150 780
!button left down
!button left up
!wait 0.4
!key calc
!wait 0.8
!key 6*7
!wait 0.4
!screenshot build/desks-2.png
!keys meta_l 1
!wait 0.5
!screenshot build/desks-3.png
!mouseto 120 400
!button left down
!button left up
!key ticks
!wait 0.5
ticks=
!keys meta_l shift 2
!wait 0.5
!screenshot build/desks-4.png
!mouseto 968 770
!button left down
!button left up
!wait 0.5
!screenshot build/desks-5.png
!mouseto 120 400
!button left down
!button left up
!key ticks
!wait 0.5
